      "configuredModel": "gpt-5.5",
      "status": "generated",
      "answer": "To enter match scores:\n\n1. On or after the scheduled match date, click the red Enter Match Scores button in the match.\n2. Select the players for each game using the dropdowns—normally use the saved Match Setup team, or change individual players if needed.\n3. Enter the scores in each game block.\n4. Click Submit; the system checks for errors before saving.\n5. The opposing captain then receives a verification request and must review, verify, or dispute the scores. The visiting captain must verify promptly so results can be entered into DUPR before the end of the weekend.\n\nImportant exceptions: if the entire match date is forfeited, canceled, or cannot be played due to weather or scheduling conflicts, do not enter it in the system; contact League Management at info@lwrpickleballclub.com. For individual game forfeits or retirements, refer to the official League Rules when entering those results. Ineligible players cannot be selected, and score fields are blocked for lines with eligibility issues.",
